OL,3,GNEWSA'Winning gold at Special Olympics
OL,4,AGB was so epic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo swimmers from Dorset are
OL,7,Fcelebrating after medal success at the
OL,8,FSpecial Olympics GB.
OL,10,FJake Binns, 22, from Shaftesbury and
OL,11,FSam Craddock, 19, from Dorchester both
OL,12,Fpicked up golds as part of the South
OL,13,FWest Team in the 4x25m relay.
OL,15,FBinns also won gold in the 25m
OL,16,Fbutterfly and silver in the 25m
OL,17,Ffreestyle event. Craddock saw success
OL,18,Fwith bronze in the 50m breast stroke.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
