OL,3,GNEWSA'Winning gold at Special Olympics
OL,4,AGB was so epic'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was so epic, I am so happy and
OL,7,Fproud," Binns told the BBC, while
OL,8,FCraddock said: "Freestyle was my
OL,9,Ffavourite swim because I got to swim
OL,10,Freally, really fast."
